WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:13.920
I'm joining Jarrod's family for lunch and everything on the menu contains crickets.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:23.120
Sister-in-law and chef Karen has cooked up her own insect recipes - everything from soup to summer rolls, even cheesecake.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.440
Is it the pepper I'm crunching or is it the cricket I'm crunching?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.120
To me, they sort of, um...

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.200
It's earthy.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.480
Mushroomy?

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.760
Yeah, mushroomy, yeah.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.240
Yes.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.960
I've got to try cheesecake.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:38.880
So has that been caramelised, that little cricket?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.320
It's been candied with some granulated honey.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.720
Right.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.680
Those are my favourite.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.160
You know, I don't like this.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.480
You've put coconut in it, haven't you?

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.960
Yes.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.280
I cannot stand coconut.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:52.560
Give me crickets any day to coconut, seriously.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.120
Coconut aside, actually, the food was really good.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:12.200
I literally thought you were just going to give me, like, a bowl of crickets and say "eat them", but the fact that it's incorporated into diet, you've got it as flour, a little sprinkling and seasoning...
